gaAA(){return"With the app open, a message may appear in a popup. When the app is not open, a device notification may arrive. Network, browser and device conditions can delay delivery."},
gasI(){return"The Notifications row in Settings shows the status and opens a dedicated screen. Under On this device, use Receive notifications; the top panel explains whether permission or a retry is needed. Activation not confirmed does not mean alerts are working: press Retry. If deactivation is incomplete, use Retry to finish it. Reminders are still configured within each project."},
