gas1(){return"If you are the owner, open project settings. To delete a group, select it and open the menu beside its name in the Selected group panel: Delete group is the last item. If it contains members, choose their destination group. Apply the change with Save changes; at least one group must remain. To permanently delete the project, choose Delete project from the top-right menu and complete the typed confirmation."},
